      "text": "```\nTEMÜJIN'S RISE:\n  Married Börte (wife kidnapped by Merkits → recovered with ally's help)\n  Alliance with Toghrul (Kerait Khan) → \"anda\" (blood brother) of Jamukha\n  Battle of Dalan Balzhut: fought Jamukha → lost, but survived\n  Gradually built coalition; won Battle of Qalaqaljid Sands\n  Defeated Tatars (who killed his father) — systematic annihilation\n  Defeated Naimans; defeated Merkits; unified all steppe peoples\n  1206: KURULTAI at the Onon River headwaters\n        Proclaimed Genghis Khagan — \"universal ruler\"\n```"
