      "text": "TACTICS:\n  Feigned retreat (quriltai tactic): draw enemy cavalry into pursuit,\n    then turn; flanking units encircle the pursuers\n  Mangudai: \"suicide cavalry\" that charged enemy and pretended to rout\n  Massed archery: composite bow with 300-yard range while riding\n  Strategic deception: send envoys; if refused, destroy; offer surrender\n    terms; if accepted, usually honored; if not, annihilate"
    },
