      "text": "SIEGE WARFARE:\n  Initially: weak at sieges (steppe nomads don't do fortifications)\n  Learned rapidly: captured Chinese engineers; later Persian engineers\n  Used catapults, gunpowder weapons, and most importantly:\n  PATIENCE — starved out cities when walls were too strong"
    },
