      },
      "text": "INTELLIGENCE:\n  Extensive use of merchants as spies\n  Yam system: information traveled faster than armies\n  Reconnoitred territory years before invasion\n  (The 1241 invasion of Poland + Hungary was planned years in advance\n   using intelligence gathered by Mongol agents)\n```"
