      "text": "SCALE:\n  At maximum (~1279): ~24 million km² — largest contiguous land empire ever\n  Population under Mongol control: ~100 million\n  Estimated deaths from Mongol conquests: 40 million (some say more)\n  (This is approximately 10% of the world's population at the time)\n  China's population dropped from ~120 million to ~80 million\n```"
